    <!-- ======================================================================== onboarding -->
    <string name="onb_step">Step %1$d of %2$d</string>
    <string name="onb_welcome_title">Your personal training coach</string>
    <string name="onb_welcome_body1">This app plans your gym sessions, guides every set and adjusts to how you feel. Everything stays on your phone: no account, no internet.</string>
    <string name="onb_welcome_body2">It is not a medical device and does not diagnose or treat anything. If you have a health condition, check with your doctor before starting a new exercise plan.</string>
    <string name="onb_welcome_body3">Setup takes about 5 minutes. You can change your answers later.</string>
    <string name="onb_welcome_accept">I understand, start setup</string>

    <string name="onb_screen_title">A few health questions</string>
    <string name="onb_screen_intro">These decide how carefully the first weeks start. Please answer each one.</string>
    <string name="screen_q1">Has a doctor said you have a heart condition, or high blood pressure that isn’t controlled?</string>
    <string name="screen_q2">Do you have diabetes, kidney disease or lung disease?</string>
    <string name="screen_q3">In the past 12 months, have you had chest pain, fainting, unexplained dizziness, or unusual breathlessness at rest or with light effort?</string>
    <string name="screen_q4">Do you have palpitations or a known heart-rhythm problem?</string>
    <string name="screen_q5">Has a doctor told you to limit exercise for any reason, or are you pregnant or recently postpartum?</string>
    <string name="screen_q6">Do you have a bone, joint or soft-tissue problem that exercise could worsen?</string>
    <string name="screen_q7">Do you take medicine for a long-term condition such as blood pressure or heart disease?</string>
    <string name="screen_q8">For the last 3 months, have you exercised on purpose at least 3 days a week for 30+ minutes at moderate effort?</string>
    <string name="screen_unanswered">Please answer every question.</string>
    <string name="screen_result_standard">Thanks. You can start with the standard plan.</string>
    <string name="screen_result_moderate">Thanks. You’ll train at moderate effort for now. Please check with your doctor before hard or interval training; once they agree, you can say so in Settings.</string>
    <string name="screen_result_conservative">Please check with your doctor before starting. Until you confirm they are happy for you to exercise, the plan stays gentle: no hard intervals, and every set stops well before failure.</string>
    <string name="screen_result_clinician">Follow your doctor’s or midwife’s guidance first. The plan stays gentle.</string>
    <string name="screen_result_note">You mentioned a joint problem or a long-term medicine: if you are unsure about an exercise, check with your clinician.</string>

